    {"NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000", "ID_OBJECT": "S209PL0002", "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT", "TEXT": "Every child trembles at the hearing of this most infamous name. This lord of hell is known for his blood thirsts. It is said that he once ate 1000 slaves at a banquet given by Bethrezen for a victory against the kingdom of light.", "SEQ_NUM": 0},
    {"NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000", "ID_OBJECT": "S209PL0003", "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT", "TEXT": "Lockjaw", "SEQ_NUM": 0},
    {"NO_SCEN": "S209SC0000", "ID_OBJECT": "S209PL0003", "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT", "TEXT": "Highest lord of the dwarf lords, he is known for his intensity in battle and his courage in the face of overwhelming odds. He once fought seven days and nights against the mighty red dragon ARFURUZON to finally defeat him.", "SEQ_NUM": 0},
